--- !u!114 &3469668424652038452
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 5
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "En mi posada se escuchan rumores de amuletos m\xE1gicos.\r\nDicen que son
    capaces de cumplir los deseos del portador...\r\nA cambio de un alto precio.\r\nUno
    que no se puede pagar con dinero."
  childrenIDs:
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 649
    y: 342
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &4833016678480741690
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Padre, \xBFse ha enterado de lo del hijo del molinero?\r\nCreo saber qu\xE9
    le ha sucedido.\r\nEstoy segura de que el colgante que menciona el peri\xF3dico
    tiene algo que ver."
  childrenIDs:
  - 2
  - 3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 5
    y: 245
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &5551701650870912134
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 13
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "Encubrimiento: Puedes irte. Tus decisiones no se volver\xE1n en tu contra."
  childrenIDs:
  - 20
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2045
    y: 656
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 1
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 1
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &5843062107677719649
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "En cuanto vi aquella joya en su cuello, le prohib\xED la entrada a la posada.\r\nSi
    los rumores son ciertos, no puedo dejar que un objeto tan peligroso entre a la
    posada.\r\nMas nunca pens\xE9 que acabar\xEDa en manos d eun pobre ni\xF1o."
  childrenIDs:
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1005
    y: 234
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &5919804849505515121
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: 'Denuncia: Ocultas informacion sobre personas peligrosas para el pueblo.
    No puedo pasarlo por alto.'
  childrenIDs:
  - 16
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2051
    y: 240
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 1
  RepPuebloCost: -1
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &6554014642214226852
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 9
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Aun as\xED, siento culpa por haber dejado marchar a aquella mujer..\r\nSi
    hubiera actuado de otra forma en cuanto vi aquel colgante...\r\nEl hijo del molinero
    segur\xEDa hoy con nosotros."
  childrenIDs:
  - 10
  - 11
  - 12
  - 13
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1708
    y: 249
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &6674409518860777732
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
